Subject: [PATCH] Androidify opencl

---
 Android.mk           | 21 +++++++++++++
 binding.gyp          | 10 ++++++-
 fakeopencl.cpp       |  0
 lib/opencl.js        |  2 +-
 package.json         | 15 ++++++----
 tools/opencl_demo.js | 83 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
